@*
    App shell chrome only: theme, dialog/toast providers, circuit-error banner. The visible
    shell (header + panes) is owned by the single page (Browse) per the layout decision
    (docs/decisions.md § Product: persistent tree + contextual pane; spec aspireldap#102).

    There is no login gate by decision (docs/decisions.md § Scope): the app binds with the
    AppHost-provided credentials and opens straight onto the directory.

    The theme is fixed to System: the nav rail that carried the chooser is deleted (#102),
    and behavior defaults move to WithLdapAdmin() options (#98) — that work wires this
    parameter; keep FluentDesignTheme usage minimal here so it merges cleanly on top.
*@
@inherits LayoutComponentBase

<FluentDesignTheme Mode="DesignThemeModes.System" />

@Body

<FluentDialogProvider />
<FluentToastProvider />

@* Kept from the template so an unhandled circuit error is still announced; hidden by the
   inline style until blazor.web.js flips display on error, so no stylesheet is needed. *@
<div id="blazor-error-ui" data-nosnippet style="display: none;">
    An unhandled error has occurred.
    <a href="." class="reload">Reload</a>
</div>
